SCOPE

This license covers the source code in this repository. It does NOT cover:

  * The DAVIS benchmark data in datasets/ — redistributed from the original
    release (Davis et al., Nat. Biotechnol. 2011) under its own terms.
  * Pretrained model weights obtained at runtime — ChemBERTa
    (DeepChem/ChemBERTa-77M-MTR), ESM-C (esmc_600m, EvolutionaryScale), and
    AlphaFold2 structures from the EBI AlphaFold Database — each governed by
    its own license.

Please cite the original sources for the data and pretrained models you use.
